{"d":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\">Piemērojamākā konvektora jauda atkarīga no telpas platības, tās siltumizolācijas. Tabulā dotas rekomendācijas, izvēloties radiatora jaudu, atkarībā no telpas laukuma un augstuma ar standarta siltumizolāciju.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table width=\"451\" cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"2\" border=\"0\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n            <p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Mērens klimats (temperatūra reti nokrīt līdz mīnus&nbsp;- 200C) 60-70 W/m2</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Normāls/auksts klimats (temperatūra bieži nokrīt līdz mīnus&nbsp;&nbsp;- 200C) 70-85 W/m2</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Konvektora jauda , W</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Te</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">lpas laukums, m2&nbsp;(griestu augstums 2,4 m)</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#009933\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Telpas laukums, m2&nbsp;(griestu augstums 2,4 m)</span></p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">400</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">3&nbsp;- 7 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">3&nbsp;- 6 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">600</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">8 - 10 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">7 - 9 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">800</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">11 - 14 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">9&nbsp;- 11 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">1000</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">14 - 16 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">12 - 14 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">1200</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">17 - 20 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">14 - 17 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">1500</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">21 - 25 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">18 - 21 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2000</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">26 - 34 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n            <td bgcolor=\"#cccccc\" bordercolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n            <p style=\"text-align: center;\">22 - 29 m2</p>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\"> </span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128);\"><strong>Ja griesti ir augstāki vai siltumizolācija slikta, rekomendējam izvēlēties radiatoru ar lielāku jaudu.</strong></span></p><br><br>"}